### 3. dashboard_cubit.dart - UPDATED ✅
**Added:** `initializeDashboard()` method

```dart
Future<void> initializeDashboard({
  required String email,
  required String userId,
  required String token,
}) async {
  emit(DashboardLoading());
  try {
    // Store token for API calls
    repository.setAuthToken(token);

    // Load dashboard data with auth token
    final stats = await repository.getDashboardStats();

    // Create UserInfo from Android data
    final userInfo = UserInfo(
      id: userId,
      email: email,
      name: email.split('@')[0],
    );

    emit(DashboardLoaded(userInfo: userInfo, stats: stats));
  } catch (e) {
    emit(DashboardError('Failed to initialize dashboard: $e'));
  }
}
```

